\title{openadmixturer: Fast ADMIXTURE Estimation on 'tidypopgen' Backing Files}
\description{
An 'R'/'Rcpp' reimplementation of the 'OpenADMIXTURE.jl' algorithm (Ko et al. 2023) for estimating individual ancestry proportions and population allele frequencies. It combines EM priming, block-wise constrained Newton updates solved with an active-set quadratic program, and quasi-Newton acceleration. Genotypes are read directly from the memory-mapped backing files of 'tidypopgen' 'gen_tibble' objects, and results are returned as 'gt_admix' objects.
